Khara sees bloodied sister and demands attacker name --- Khara vows to kill foe with arrows --- Khara claims none save Indra can wrong him --- Śūrpaṇakhā describes two handsome youths and adorned woman --- Śūrpaṇakhā blames pair and demands their battlefield blood --- Khara orders fourteen deathlike Rākṣasas to kill trio --- Khara promises sister will drink victims blood --- Fourteen Rākṣasas leave with Śūrpaṇakhā like clouds